{
  "_comment": [
    "Strict role gate for the resume hub (used by role_filter.py and",
    "run_resume_creation.py --refilter). Decisions per job, in order:",
    "  1. a drop_title pattern in the job TITLE  -> prune (other-domain role)",
    "  2. a keep_title pattern in the job TITLE  -> keep (software / AI / data /",
    "     IT / automation / hardware roles)",
    "  3. otherwise the engine's own domain gate (knowledge_base/domain_filters.json,",
    "     false-positive keywords fixed 2026-09-20) decides from the JD text.",
    "Patterns are lowercase substrings matched against the lowercased title, so",
    "German compounds match too ('marketing' hits 'Marketingprogramme'). Keep",
    "patterns specific: bare 'development' or 'ai' would over/under-match.",
    "Management-flavoured QM ('quality management') is dropped; software QA",
    "('quality assurance', 'test automation') is not."
  ],
